   "source": [
    "memo_content = \"\"\"# EXECUTIVE MEMORANDUM: TELECOM CHURN & RETENTION STRATEGY\n",
    "\n",
    "**TO:** Chief Executive Officer & Chief Financial Officer  \n",
    "**FROM:** Lead Data Scientist & AI Strategy Team  \n",
    "**DATE:** September 2026  \n",
    "**SUBJECT:** Data-Driven Customer Retention Program & Governance Framework  \n",
    "\n",
    "--- \n",
    "\n",
    "### Executive Summary\n",
    "An analysis of 7,043 customer accounts identified an overall annual churn rate of **26.54%**, representing significant recurring revenue loss. Using an audited Machine Learning pipeline, we isolated **$127,734.69 in monthly revenue at risk** within our highest priority customer segment. \n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Findings & Targeted Retention Segment\n",
    "We recommend launching the initial retention campaign targeting **Segment 1: New, High-Spend, High-Risk Customers**.\n",
    "- **Segment Size:** 2,111 customers (30% of base)\n",
    "- **Average Monthly Bill:** $79.14\n",
    "- **Average Churn Risk:** 76.40%\n",
    "- **Financial Impact:** Preserving just 15% of this segment recovers ~$19,160 in monthly recurring revenue ($230,000+ annualized).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Predictive Model Performance & Controls\n",
    "- **Selected Model:** Random Forest Classifier\n",
    "- **Recall Rate:** 71.12% (successfully flags 7 out of 10 true churners prior to cancellation)\n",
    "- **ROC-AUC Score:** 0.832\n",
    "- **Overfitting Mitigation:** Constrained tree depth maintains a manageable 14.99 percentage point train-test accuracy gap, ensuring robustness on real-world data.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Governance, Auditability & Ethics\n",
    "To ensure complete non-discrimination compliance:\n",
    "1. **Demographic Stripping:** Protected variables (*gender, SeniorCitizen, Partner, Dependents*) were strictly excluded from model feature sets and
